<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>NOAA lists 305 flash flood reports in Dallas County since 1996, plus 22 additional flood reports.</li>
<li>On August 21–22, 2022, upwards of 15 inches of rain fell in parts of Dallas, flooding homes, apartments, and dozens of roads.</li>
<li>Standard homeowners and commercial policies generally exclude flood. Coverage comes from the NFIP or a private flood policy.</li>
<li>Water from a burst pipe or rain through a storm-damaged roof is different from flood and is often covered by a homeowners policy.</li>
